{room, key=bedroom, name=Your Bedroom
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
South: exit your room
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        output={@

You are in your bedroom.
Against the west wall is your desk.
Against the opposite wall is your bed and a small table with a TV on it.
Along the south wall is a bookshelf and next to that the door.
In the north wall is a window that you've taped SciFi posters all over.

(Hint: You can examine things using: x item)

Your room is cluttered with clothes strewn over the floor. Techno music is playing on a small computer speaker.
The only light that's on is a blue bulb hanging from the ceiling.
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@

You look around...
Against the west wall is your desk.
Against the opposite wall is your bed and a small table with a TV on it.
Along the south wall is a bookshelf and next to that the door.
In the north wall is the window.
            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=./objects/bed.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/cd.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/cdplayer.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/bookshelf.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/desk.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/entertainment.inj }


    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }
}
